```

Wait, but `UnsizedOffsetListOf::operator[]` does `this+this->arrayZ[i]`, which calls `operator+`:
```cpp
template <typename Base, typename OffsetType, bool has_null, typename Type>
static inline const Type& operator + (const Base &base, const OffsetTo<Type, OffsetType, has_null> &offset) { return offset (base); }
```

So `this+this->arrayZ[i]` calls `this->arrayZ[i](this)`, which is `OffsetTo<Lookup<GlyphID>, HBUINT32>::operator()(this)`. This does:
```cpp
